msgid "MyST Markdown authoring"
msgstr "Redactar MyST Markdown"

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:443
msgid ""
"MyST Markdown supports the same directives and roles through fenced "
"blocks:"
msgstr ""
"MyST Markdown admite las mismas directivas y roles mediante bloques "
